{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cell of the Colombian Cartel has quietly settled in the small town of Milenagrad in the east of Russia. Having an agreement with the leadership of the local Police, they have established sales of their products, thereby harassing the local population. But honest Major Stepanovich does not like this arrangement and he decided to call an old friend who recently returned - Gena &quot;Baston&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will have to clear your native lands of the impending threat, while completing small quests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mix of adventure with a classic first-person shooter</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep comedy-dramatic plot</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The presence of memes, references, jokes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can boost hero's stats</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He's going to restore order...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3862070/extras/7b7b730c8f81be86ac0570eabfc8252d.poster.avif?t=1758448050\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3862070/extras/7b7b730c8f81be86ac0570eabfc8252d.webm?t=1758448050\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3862070/extras/7b7b730c8f81be86ac0570eabfc8252d.mp4?t=1758448050\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3862070?t=1758448050","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3862070/efdca42ff89ec8e4b7474664d6863d8ab2abef70/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758448050","capsule_image":"htt